# Build context hygiene. The image installs its own dependencies inside the
# deps stage, so the host's node_modules must never enter the context: a
# Windows/macOS tree copied over the container's install breaks the build
# (and `bun run build` then fails with "next: command not found").
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
.turbo
**/.turbo
target
**/target
coverage
**/coverage
test-results
**/test-results
playwright-report
**/playwright-report
.git
# Secrets stay out of the image, exactly as they stay out of git.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
